= David M. Roxe
{parent=List of physicians}
{c}

Author of <Urinalysis in Clinical Methods by David M. Roxe>, identified by the chapter and https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/21250145/[PubMed record]. No birth dates or expanded name are inferred.

A bounded exact-name and institutional portrait search did not establish a securely identified portrait. The https://www.vitals.com/doctors/david-roxe-t3x162[commercial physician profile] returned an image label, but this was not sufficient to establish an authenticated portrait of the chapter author; no likeness is supplied.

