= John Zachariah Laurence
{parent=List of physicians}
{c}

Surgeon and ophthalmologist; author of the 1856 <Illustrations of the Pathology of Cancer by John Zachariah Laurence>. Identity: https://wellcomecollection.org/works/wmmt58cd. The catalogue gives an uncertain birth year, so no exact birth date is inferred.

Verified external portrait attempt: https://acnr.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/ACNR-V20I1-web-1.pdf[ACNR, volume 20, issue 1, history feature, Figure 1: John Zachariah Laurence]. The indexed facsimile caption identifies the pictured person. A separate https://wellcomecollection.org/search/works?page=43&query=PORTRAIT+PHOTOGRAPH[Wellcome portrait-photograph catalogue result] records M0017615, reference WT/D/1/20/1/157/85. No portrait file is copied into the repository.

