= John Snow
{parent=List of physicians}
{c}
{title2=1813–1858}

A <physician> whose <On the Mode of Communication of Cholera by John Snow> investigated relations between water supplies and <cholera>. External portrait: https://collection.sciencemuseumgroup.org.uk/people/cp85845[Science Museum Group, portrait of John Snow].

