{parent=John Snow}

= W. Ernest Thomson
{parent=List of physicians}
{c}

Author of the 1894 physical taper comparison in <The True Position of Oxygen as a Restorative in Carbonic Acid Poisoning by W. Ernest Thomson>. The author identity and career are corroborated by the https://bjo.bmj.com/content/bjophthalmol/22/1/59.full.pdf[British Journal of Ophthalmology obituary, 1938, p. 59, identifying the thesis and its publication]. Exact-name portrait searches did not establish a securely identified portrait; no portrait or dates are invented.

= Work by W. Ernest Thomson
{parent=W. Ernest Thomson}

