= Molinelli
{c}
{synonym}

The author called Molinellius in the Oxford extract from <The Seats and Causes of Diseases Investigated by Anatomy by Giovanni Battista Morgagni>. Pier Paolo Molinelli is a candidate identification with a verified institutional portrait, but the extract does not give his forenames; retain that qualification pending verification of the cited original observation.

= Riolan cited by Morgagni
{parent=List of physicians}
{c}

= Riolan
{c}
{synonym}

The physician named only as Riolanus in the Oxford extract from <The Seats and Causes of Diseases Investigated by Anatomy by Giovanni Battista Morgagni>, cited for duodenal compression. The extract alone does not distinguish the elder from the younger Riolan. A portrait and exact Wikipedia article for the younger were verified as candidates, without assigning them to this uncertain reference.

